## Running the App

### Development Mode (using platform runner)
```bash
{{if hasPlatform .Platforms "macos" -}}
cd macos  # or other platform
{{else if hasPlatform .Platforms "windows" -}}
cd windows  # or other platform
{{else if hasPlatform .Platforms "linux" -}}
cd linux  # or other platform
{{else -}}
cd macos  # or windows, or linux
{{end -}}
go run main.go
```

### Build for Platform

{{if hasPlatform .Platforms "macos" -}}
#### macOS
```bash
cd macos
go build -o {{.ProjectName}}
./{{.ProjectName}}
```
{{end}}
{{if hasPlatform .Platforms "windows" -}}
#### Windows
```bash
cd windows
go build -o {{.ProjectName}}.exe
{{.ProjectName}}.exe
```
{{end}}
{{if hasPlatform .Platforms "linux" -}}
#### Linux
```bash
cd linux
go build -o {{.ProjectName}}
./{{.ProjectName}}
```
{{end}}
